    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 103,
        "text": "I saw your message about the community conversation on Saturday. Did you mean ten in the morning?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "581952cbaf37b9bdfb9c75c5f8e66b71878f5d4a34c17f1965378f949172188f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "paul",
        "speaker": "Paul",
        "sourceStart": 110,
        "sourceEnd": 210,
        "text": "I meant two in the afternoon. I should have written the time clearly. I apologize for the confusion.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "80a7933055c4ab1ff4d6c541fdaf47b461e2f8ac46281cbd3dc26d0607c6d3b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 217,
        "sourceEnd": 345,
        "text": "Thanks for explaining. The poster says “Saturday” but does not mention a time. We should clarify it before we print more copies.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7192af8d41d0456a29fd5b4afb550297eaa521cd843fe0c7e2e304ca882a9d7f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "paul",
        "speaker": "Paul",
        "sourceStart": 352,
        "sourceEnd": 464,
        "text": "I agree. Could you tell me whether the hall is free at two? I have not received a response from the manager yet.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "99732e5ff5437ee6036c6447db4a7e7b16da298f102f866a792614b2db73374c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 471,
        "sourceEnd": 573,
        "text": "I can ask her now. Our purpose is to make sure people have the right information, not to blame anyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "944c0f4387af489953bdfedb96c70d29a18bb01070c7f9afdc7f2e8b0a5219b2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "paul",
        "speaker": "Paul",
        "sourceStart": 580,
        "sourceEnd": 681,
        "text": "Good. The dialogue will be informal, and everyone can share an opinion about neighborhood activities.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "49b65c71f47550ba0744dea194837aad35d301900764f2581bc3077f1312ebf2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 688,
        "sourceEnd": 766,
        "text": "The manager says the hall is free at two. She asks us to remind her on Friday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7c056b766fd34838b441579820c98ef053fa85deb37c83a737e77a40382c3b7e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "paul",
        "speaker": "Paul",
        "sourceStart": 773,
        "sourceEnd": 848,
        "text": "I will reply to her message. Could you repeat which door people should use?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d7d38c1ba60e7cc2224f24a94bfb175afdbcd50d04aa4194ac7fd806b3868e4d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 855,
        "sourceEnd": 960,
        "text": "The side door. The main door is being repaired. Please describe that on the poster in one short sentence.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "744b750ef2010c22e11c5a237c9d62c290ea4eb560ff3ae4815999f050e0fce8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "paul",
        "speaker": "Paul",
        "sourceStart": 967,
        "sourceEnd": 1025,
        "text": "How about the phrase “Please enter through the side door”?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "52097562409a96baf8933fc2139b4452afda79f2fb433060725678a73d0301a6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 1032,
        "sourceEnd": 1124,
        "text": "That sounds polite and easy to understand. We can also include a phone number for questions.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0aee09e8051e7274616804b1a568d27620932a4a7e275953a8d1796803d1b86c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 1131,
        "sourceEnd": 1233,
        "text": "I suggest we explain the reason for the change in a short, clear message, rather than a formal letter.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "57e2a947313b11ad8e11136e644bdcbf32d7bfe599140b75b36a2db67a6ac15c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "paul",
        "speaker": "Paul",
        "sourceStart": 1240,
        "sourceEnd": 1306,
        "text": "Is the change urgent? I do not want our tone to make people upset.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d4538fd5b8c37d6e9b63dd0089c33201ce861a03b7701f51398abd866cd66276",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 1313,
        "sourceEnd": 1400,
        "text": "We have three days, so it is not an emergency. We should still update the poster today.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f1e2528325c82491dbb5c126138079e70c9312ab0af4f40f899a490251827286",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "paul",
        "speaker": "Paul",
        "sourceStart": 1407,
        "sourceEnd": 1509,
        "text": "I will listen to your suggestion and check the time once more. Then I will send you the final version.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "41333ea13b9d2d1ab9d05ab2f0c4f7208b66c85a6c6d0fb9e34e93cade718770",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "iris",
        "speaker": "Iris",
        "sourceStart": 1516,
        "sourceEnd": 1652,
        "text": "Thank you. This exchange has helped us communicate the plan clearly. After people arrive, we can discuss their ideas for the next event.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8bcfa600f736777326329865807a1568a0dc4364234ea9a4aba5293064c7aa7a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
